//! Differential tests against the Fraunhofer C++ reference implementation.
//!
//! `build.rs` compiles the C++ sources (see `MPEGHDEC_C_DIR`) together with the C shims in
//! `shim/`. Each shim file `shim/<name>.cpp` exposes internal C++ functions with C linkage; the
//! module `<name>` contains the matching declarations generated by
//! `scripts/codegen/gen_cref_bindings.py`. The tests in `tests/` compare the Rust port against
//! them.
//!
//! If the C++ sources are not available, the `cref_missing` cfg is set and the bindings and tests
//! are compiled out.

